; apexmetabolichealth.com.au — full zone, copied from Wix DNS on 2026-09-13
; for import into Cloudflare. Adds the 2 Mailgun MX records GHL needs on mail.
$ORIGIN apexmetabolichealth.com.au.
$TTL 3600

; --- Website (Vercel) ---
